
| Variable | Description | Default |
|----------|-------------|---------|
| `TARGET_URL` | Base URL to scrape | `http://books.toscrape.com` |
| `REQUEST_DELAY` | Seconds between requests | `1` |

---

## Output

The scraper produces three files:

| File | Format | Description |
|------|--------|-------------|
| `books.csv` | CSV | Tabular data for spreadsheet tools |
| `books.json` | JSON | Array of book objects |
| `books.db` | SQLite | Database with `books` table |

---

## Logging

Logs are written to console and `scraper.log` with rotating levels (INFO, DEBUG, ERROR). Adjust log level in `scraper.py` if needed.

